  <h2>4 Exposure & Color Metrics Every Cameraman Must Know</h2>
  <p><b>1. Nits Brightness vs Direct Sunlight:</b> 500 Nits monitors indoor/shade ke liye perfect hain, lekin outdoor afternoon sunlight me sunhood ke bina washed out ho jate hain. 2800 Nits (Desview R6) direct sunlight me saaf dikhta hai.<br>
  <b>2. False Color IRE Chart for S-Log3 / C-Log2:</b> Skin tones ko perfect expose karne ke liye False Color tool 40-45 IRE (Green) par Wheatish skin tone aur 60-65 IRE (Pink) par Fair skin tone dikhata hai. Blown-out highlights Red (100+ IRE) dikhte hain.<br>
  <b>3. Waveform (RGB Parade):</b> Waveform graph me exact positioning pata chalti hai ki kaunsa frame corner overexposed hai.<br>
  <b>4. 3D LUT Support (.CUBE):</b> SD card se custom 33x33 `.CUBE` LUT load karke screen par graded look live preview kar sakte hain.</p>

